      "source": "SmartScreen for apps and files (Explorer value) and the policy 'Configure Windows Defender SmartScreen' (EnableSmartScreen, Policy CSP SmartScreen); Windows Security. Mesura does not script this: its values live under policy and per-user keys Windows re-evaluates, so the app-and-browser-control page is the reliable, reversible control.",
      "observe": {
