      "category": "Appearance",
      "impact": "interface",
      "summary": "Stops third-party app and content suggestions in spotlight, Start and tips.",
      "description": "Sets the per-user policy 'Do not suggest third-party content in Windows spotlight'. Microsoft documents that Windows then stops offering app and content suggestions from third-party publishers in Windows spotlight features such as the lock screen, suggested apps in Start, and Windows tips. The user policy lives in the CloudContent policy key of the current user.",
      "risk": "userPreference",
