      "source": "Microsoft Learn Policy CSP Search 'AllowSearchHighlights': 0 turns search highlights off in search home and the taskbar/Start search box, 1 (default) on; Group Policy 'Allow search highlights', key SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Windows Search, value EnableDynamicContentInWSB (Search.admx); Windows 10 20H2+ with KB5011543 and Windows 11 21H2 with KB5023774 and later; Pro/Enterprise/Education. Local Search.admx (Windows 11 build 26200) confirms enabledValue 1 / disabledValue 0.",
