      "name": "Turn off Edge feature recommendations and tips",
      "category": "Microsoft Edge",
      "impact": "interface",
      "summary": "Edge stops flyouts and coach marks that recommend its features.",
      "description": "Edge shows in-browser notifications (dialogs, flyouts, coach marks, banners) that recommend features, for example suggesting vertical tabs when many tabs are open. This sets the Edge policy ShowRecommendationsEnabled to 0, so users receive no recommendations or notifications from Edge. The deprecated PromotionalTabsEnabled policy points to this one as its replacement.",
