      "description": "SMB 1.0 is the old file-sharing protocol that Microsoft deprecated in 2014 and strongly advises against. It is not installed on a clean Windows 11 install, but it can still be present on upgraded systems and on Windows 10 Home and Pro installs. This turns off the SMB1Protocol optional feature.",
