      "source": "Microsoft Learn Policy CSP Privacy 'AllowCrossDeviceClipboard': 0 = not allowed, 1 (default) = allowed; 'When disabled, Clipboard contents can't be shared to other devices'; takes effect immediately; Windows 10 1809+; Pro/Enterprise/Education; Group Policy 'Allow Clipboard synchronization across devices', key Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\System, value AllowCrossDeviceClipboard (OSPolicy.admx). Learn 'Manage connections...' item 30 'Cloud Clipboard' (most restricted value 0). Local OSPolicy.admx (build 26200) confirms enabledValue 1 / disabledValue 0. A Tenable CIS audit page recommends Disabled for the same policy.",
