      "source": "Microsoft Learn Policy CSP Search 'AllowCloudSearch': 'Allow search and Cortana to search cloud sources like OneDrive and SharePoint', 0 = not allowed, 1 (default) = allowed; Windows 10 1709+; Pro/Enterprise/Education; Group Policy 'Allow Cloud Search', key SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Windows Search. The value name AllowCloudSearch and its dropdown 0/1/2 (disabled/enabled/user selected) are from the local Search.admx (Windows 11 build 26200); allthings.how and anoopcnair.com independently give HKLM ...\\Windows Search\\AllowCloudSearch = 0 for 'off for all users'. Microsoft support page 'Windows Search and privacy' describes cloud content search for Microsoft and work or school accounts.",
