      "description": "Edge's shopping features (price comparison, coupons, rebates, auto-applied coupons and express checkout) are applied automatically on retail domains; Microsoft says coupons for the current retailer and prices from other retailers are fetched from a server. This sets the Edge policy EdgeShoppingAssistantEnabled to 0, so these features are no longer found automatically.",
