      "source": "Microsoft Learn, Edge policy EdgeShoppingAssistantEnabled ('Shopping in Microsoft Edge Enabled'): enabled or not configured means price comparison, coupons, rebates and express checkout apply automatically and 'Coupons for the current retailer and prices from other retailers are fetched from a server'; disabled means they are not found automatically; REG_DWORD, Edge 87+, 'Applies to a profile that is signed in with a Microsoft account: No'. The name ShoppingAssistantEnabled returned HTTP 404 on Learn and was not used.",
      "sources": [
