      "description": "This sets the Edge policy PersonalizationReportingEnabled to 0. Microsoft describes it as preventing Microsoft from collecting your Edge browsing history, favorites and collections, usage and other browsing data to personalize advertising, search, news, Edge and other Microsoft services. When disabled, users cannot change it.",
