      "source": "Microsoft Learn, Edge policy SleepingTabsEnabled: 'Sleeping tabs reduces CPU, battery, and memory usage by putting idle background tabs to sleep... By default, sleeping tabs is turned on... If this policy is enabled, sleeping tabs are turned on'; REG_DWORD, Edge 88+.",
      "sources": [
        "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/deployedge/microsoft-edge-policies/sleepingtabsenabled"
