      "description": "Web Proxy Auto-Discovery (WPAD) lets Windows find a proxy configuration (PAC file) from the local network or DNS. Microsoft documents a WinHTTP registry value that disables WPAD detection for all proxy-detection calls made through the WinHTTP API, for people who prefer to manage endpoints directly. Anyone on the same network who can answer the WPAD lookup could otherwise point WinHTTP traffic at a proxy of their choosing.",
