      "category": "Microsoft Edge",
      "impact": "interface",
      "summary": "Edge hides Microsoft Rewards prompts and notifications.",
      "description": "This sets the Edge policy ShowMicrosoftRewards to 0. Per Microsoft, Microsoft account users in search, new tab page and earn markets no longer see the Microsoft Rewards experience in their Edge profile, and the Rewards switch in Edge settings is disabled and toggled off.",
      "risk": "userPreference",
