      "limitations": "Edge will show 'Managed by your organization'. If you collect Microsoft Rewards points through Edge, you lose that. Needs an Edge restart. Microsoft's page flags the policy as not applying to a profile signed in with a Microsoft account, yet its description speaks about Microsoft account users; the two conflict, so verify in edge://policy. Supported from Edge 88.",
      "source": "Microsoft Learn, Edge policy ShowMicrosoftRewards: if disabled, 'Microsoft account users... won't see the Microsoft Rewards experience in their Microsoft Edge user profile. The setting to enable Microsoft Rewards in Microsoft Edge settings is disabled and toggled off'; REG_DWORD, Edge 88+; restart required.",
